{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48219","headline":"咏傅岩监祠 · 梁载言","name":"咏傅岩监祠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻道监中溜，初言是大祠。\n很傍索传马，𬾠动出安徽\n卫司无帟幕，供膳乏鲜肥。\n形容消瘦尽，空往复空归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"梁载言","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48219.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48219","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}